{
  "job_B14.2_20251003_114305": {
    "text": "\u00deis syndon \u00fea domas \u00f0e Hlo\u00feh\u00e6re & Eadric, Cantwara cyningas, asetton.\nHlo\u00feh\u00e6re & Eadric Cantwara cyningas ecton \u00fea \u00e6, \u00fea \u00f0e heora aldoras \u00e6r geworhton, \u00f0yssum domum\nGif mannes esne eorlcundne mannan ofsl\u00e6h\u00f0, \u00feane \u00f0e sio \u00fereom hundum scillinga gylde, se agend \u00feone\nGif se bane o\u00febyrste, feor\u00fee manwyr\u00f0 he togedo & hine gec\u00e6nne mid godum \u00e6wdum, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00feane\nGif mannes esne frigne mannan ofsl\u00e6h\u00f0, \u00feane \u00fee sie hund scillinga gelde, se agend \u00feone banan agefe &\nGif bana o\u00febyrste, twam manwyr\u00feum hine man forgelde & hine gec\u00e6nne mid godum \u00e6wdum, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nGif frigman mannan forstele, gif he eft cuma stermelda, secge an andweardne; gec\u00e6nne hine, gif he\nGif ceorl acwyle be libbendum wife & bearne, riht is \u00fe\u00e6t hit, \u00fe\u00e6t bearn, medder folgige, & him mon an\nGif man o\u00ferum m\u00e6n feoh forstele, & se agend hit eft \u00e6tfo, geteme to cynges sele, gif he m\u00e6ge, & \u00feone\nGif man o\u00feerne sace tihte & he \u00feane mannan mote an medle o\u00fe\u00fee an \u00feinge, symble se man \u00feam o\u00f0rum\nGif he \u00f0onne byrigan forw\u00e6rne, XII scillingas agylde \u00feam cyninge, & sio se sacy swa open swa hio \u00e6r\nGif man o\u00feerne tihte, si\u00fe\u00fean he him byrigan gesealdne h\u00e6bbe, & \u00f0onne ymb III niht gesec\u00e6n hiom\nGif he \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t nille, gelde \u00feonne C buton a\u00f0e, si\u00fe\u00fean ane neaht ofer \u00fe\u00e6t gesem hie.\nGif man mannan an o\u00feres flette manswara hate\u00fe o\u00f0\u00f0e hine mid bism\u00e6rwordum scandlice grete, scilling\nGif man o\u00ferum steop asette \u00f0\u00e6r m\u00e6n drincen, buton scylde, an eald riht scilling agelde \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t flet\nGif man w\u00e6pn abregde \u00fe\u00e6r m\u00e6n drincen & \u00f0\u00e6r man nan yfel ne de\u00fe, scilling \u00fean \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t flet age, &\nGif \u00fe\u00e6t flet geblodgad wyr\u00fee, forgylde \u00feem m\u00e6n his mundbyrd & cyninge L scillinga.\nGif man cuman feorm\u00e6\u00fe III niht an his agenum hame cepeman o\u00fe\u00fee o\u00f0erne \u00fee sio ofer mearce cuman\nGif Cantwara \u00e6nig in Lundenwic feoh gebycge, h\u00e6bbe him \u00feonne twegen o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00f0reo unfacne ceorlas to\nGif hit man eft \u00e6t \u00feam m\u00e6n in C\u00e6nt \u00e6tfo, \u00feonne t\u00e6me he to wic to cyng\u00e6s sele to \u00feam m\u00e6n \u00f0e him\nGif he \u00fe\u00e6t ne m\u00e6ge, geky\u00fee \u00f0anne in wiofode mid his gewitena anum o\u00fe\u00fee mid cyninges\nGif he \u00feanne \u00fe\u00e6t ne m\u00e6ge gecy\u00fean mid rihtre canne, l\u00e6te \u00feanne an, & se agend tofo.",
